---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---
<Base title="About" description="Who CatichkaBeta is and what we do.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p class="lede">CatichkaBeta is three friends building apps and games, and making a space for the people we know who are using AI in interesting ways.</p>
    <p>[Cat: a paragraph on how CatichkaBeta started and why.]</p>
    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <p>We make apps and games, and we use AI at every step: art, code, music, testing and ideas. You can see what we're working on in <a href="/projects/">Projects</a>.</p>
    <h2>Why this site</h2>
    <p>Everyone we know is figuring out AI in their own way. Some of it is brilliant and most of it never gets shared. This is a place to write it down: what worked, what didn't, and the code to try it yourself.</p>
    <h2>The founders</h2>
    <p>Meet us on the <a href="/people/">People</a> page.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
